摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH/Codex × SolidWorks & AutoCAD · on-demand skills + MCP servers for real CAD automation (Windows, COM)","id":"gh:1430652159","install_available":true,"language":"PowerShell","name":"dsh-sw-cad","slug":"27painter/dsh-sw-cad","topics":["ai-agent","autocad","cad","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","mcp","solidworks","windows"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH/Codex × SolidWorks & AutoCAD · on-demand skills + MCP servers for real CAD automation (Windows, "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"Codex × SolidWorks & AutoCAD · on-demand skills + MCP servers for real CAD automation (Windows, COM)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-sw-cad"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Two MCP servers and two skills that let a DeepSeek Harness or Codex agent drive real CAD software."},{"id":"p3s2","text":"**\nThey wire up two existing open-source projects — U-C4N/Autocad-MCP\nand wzyn20051216/solidworks-au"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"tomation-skill —\nso an agent can draw in AutoCAD, model in SolidWorks, and export the results. This "},{"id":"p3s4","text":"repository is the\nconfiguration layer: isolated environments, launch parameters, on-demand loading a"},{"id":"p3s5","text":"nd client registration.\nIt does not fork, patch or repackage either server. Both now hide their cata"},{"id":"p3s6","text":"logs behind their own\ndiscovery mode, so this repository no longer ships one: it configures theirs."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What it does, and when you want it"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"A CLI agent that can read a drawing is useful. One that can *produce* one is a different tool. With "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"this\nkit installed, dsh or Codex can take a sentence like \"draw an M6 threaded-hole bracket on an IS"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"O A3 sheet\nand export PDF\" and actually do it — create layers, draw geometry, dimension it, stamp a "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"title block,\nrun a validator, and hand back a file."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The catch is the same as every COM automation: **the CAD application must be running, and the agent "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"must\nrun as the same Windows user and integrity level as the CAD app.** This is not a cloud service "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"and there\nis no headless substitute for native `.dwg` / `.sldprt` output."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Two skills are the entry points. They load lazily — the SKILL.md is read only when a request matches"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" its\ndescription, so an idle session pays nothing for them:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Skill | How it works |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| `solidworks-automation` | Script-driven: 66 Python modules (30 `sw_*.py` COM wrappers plus OCCT/FE"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"A/DFM tooling), with preflight, capability gating and evidence chains |\n| `autocad-mcp-pro` | Author"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ed here (upstream ships no AutoCAD skill). Drives the AutoCAD MCP through its two meta-tools |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Two MCP servers are the muscle, registered in the client config:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Server | Tools advertised | Idle cost | Mode |\n|---|---:|---:|---|\n| `autocad` | 2 | 365 tokens | "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"Upstream `DISCOVERY_MODE=search`: only `search_tools` + `call_tool`; the 242-tool catalog is searche"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"d by keyword |\n| `solidworks` | 3 | 474 tokens | Upstream `SW_MCP_DISCOVERY=search`: `sw_search_tool"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"s`, `sw_describe_tool`, `sw_call_tool`; the 66-tool catalog (50 `solidworks_*` + 14 `cadstudio_*` + "},{"id":"p12s5","text":"2 `design_*`) is searched on demand, and would otherwise cost 23,411 |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"*Tool schemas are paid for before the first request. Connected directly the two servers cost 107,143"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"\ntokens; through this kit they cost 839, a 99.2% cut. Both sides are measured the same way: the\n`too"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"ls/list` bytes on the wire, counted with `cl100k_base`.*"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## What is upstream, what is ours"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"This matters more than usual here, because the two servers are other people's work. The split is:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Part | Origin | License |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| AutoCAD MCP server (`autocad-mcp-pro`) | U-C4N/Autocad-MCP, installed from PyPI | MIT |\n| SolidWor"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ks skill + MCP server | wzyn20051216/solidworks-automation-skill, cloned at install time | MIT |\n| `"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"skills/autocad-mcp-pro/SKILL.md` | Authored here — upstream has no AutoCAD skill | MIT |\n| `bin/`, `"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"lib/` (including `probe.py`, which checks for the CAD COM servers), `package.json`, `cordis.patch.ym"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"l`, `install.ps1`, `bootstrap.ps1`, `codex-config.snippet.toml`, `assets/`, READMEs | Authored here "},{"id":"p18s6","text":"stall.ps1`, `bootstrap.ps1`, `codex-config.snippet.toml`, `assets/`, READMEs | Authored here | MIT |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Nothing upstream is vendored.** The installer fetches the PyPI package and clones (or zip-download"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"s) the\nSolidWorks repository at install time, so you always get upstream's current code and upstream"},{"id":"p19s3","text":" keeps\nownership of it. The value this repository adds is the part that was missing: verified launch"},{"id":"p19s4","text":" parameters,\nthe discovery-mode configuration for both servers, the on-demand skill wiring, the junc"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"tion trick that\nkeeps gigabytes off C:, and an installer that survives a blocked git\nprotocol."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**One exception, and it is deliberate:** `patches/` carries two fixes for upstream defects that are\n"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"silent — a vertical linear dimension measures 0.0, and every edge's diameter and length come back nu"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ll.\nBoth are open as pull requests upstream; until they land, `install.ps1` applies the patches to t"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"he\ninstalled copies and `bootstrap.ps1` reports whether they are in place. See\n`patches/README.md`."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Prerequisites"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- Windows 10/11 with AutoCAD and/or SolidWorks installed\n- Python ≥ 3.11 on PATH (`python --version`"},{"id":"p22s2","text":")\n- dsh (DeepSeek Harness) or Codex CLI; Node ≥ 20 for routes 1 and 2\n- Git — optional; the installe"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"r falls back to a codeload zip when git is blocked"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### What if the CAD applications are not installed"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The plugin checks for both COM servers before registering anything (`lib/probe.py`, a registry\nProgI"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"D lookup — it does not launch either application). A machine with only AutoCAD registers only\nthe Au"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"toCAD server, and vice versa; a machine with neither registers nothing and says so in the log\ninstea"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"d of offering tools that could only fail."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"`SW_CAD_DISABLE=autocad,solidworks` turns that decision into a setting, and\n`dsh-sw-cad doctor` prin"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ts what the probe found without starting dsh."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Note that *installed* is not the same as *running*. AutoCAD registered but closed means the AutoCAD\n"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"tools wait for the application and then fail with a message about a modal dialog; SolidWorks' own\nhe"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"alth check reports the install, not the running instance. Starting the CAD application as the same\nW"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"indows user as your agent is the last step of any install."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Appendix — what `install.ps1` does"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"`install.ps1` runs everything in the appendix above, plus the parts that are easy to get wrong: both"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" venvs on the data\ndrive, the junctions, the discovery-mode parameters, and a timestamped backup of "},{"id":"p29s3","text":"`~/.dsh/cordis.patch.yml`."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"It checks Python, creates the directories, builds the venvs, installs `autocad-mcp-pro[full]` and th"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"e\nSolidWorks requirements, fetches the skill at the pinned commit (zip, so git is not needed), appli"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"es\n`patches/` to the installed copies, junctions the skills into `~/.dsh/skills`, writes the dsh con"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"fig,\nand drops the AutoCAD skill in place."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"If you are not sure what is already on the machine, run `bootstrap.ps1` instead: it decides whether\n"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"re not sure what is already on the machine, run `bootstrap.ps1` instead: it decides whether\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
